# UNDERDELVE: the Old Lode (8 hits) can only be hurt when it slams down.
# Beating it opens the east wall; the Sunstone wins the game (Saucer), and
# with all six lanterns still lit, the Alien too.
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 5
cheat room 6 0 60 130
wait 5
expect boss_hp == 8
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 8
cheat boss_ground
cheat pos 100 130
wait 2
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 7
cheat boss_hp 1
press B
wait 20
wait 160
expect boss_dead == 1
cheat room 7 0 150 98
hold RIGHT 30
expect state == 5
expect goals & 2
expect goals & 4
